{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"sarcastic-specified-kodiakbear","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Detect a clone whose last convergence with the remote exceeds the N-day horizon and force it to override local state with remote on reconnect (rather than reintroducing pre-compaction events by rebase). This converts the remote-anchored horizon from probabilistic to enforced (closes the I1 hole). Accepted cost: discards the stale clone's divergent local work. Independently verifiable: a simulated >N-day-stale clone is overridden, not merged.","id":"aff9-1252-ad21-4695","parent_id":"536b-8930-b922-4063","priority":3,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"story","title":"Stale-clone detection + forced remote-override on reconnect"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787594790468650001,"uuid":"addc6b51-d932-4eb5-ba64-24a362ddf205"}